- Application mark tokens (hst::design::AppMark, Palette::aAppMark) and the unit tests of the document tab
  strip's coat: app marks reach 3:1 on the frame surfaces, the module-to-mark mapping, the strip's pixels in
  light and dark at 100 and 125 %, the close-button hover, the vector fallback of the glyphs, the close
  button's size, the strip height, and the strip's accessible tree (tabs, close buttons, "+").

